<![CDATA[<p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Dear [Dr./Prof.] {!IndividualApplication.PI_Name__c},</p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;">This is to inform you that the application titled <span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; pointer-events: auto;">“{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}”</span> has been successfully <span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; pointer-events: auto;">submitted</span> to the {!Get_COE_Contact.Name} on <span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; pointer-events: auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!IndividualApplication.AppliedDate}</span>.</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 13px;">Should any additional documents or clarifications be required, you will be notified promptly.</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 13px;"><br></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 13px;">Sincerely,</p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; pointer-events: auto; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 13px;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; pointer-events: auto;">Wadhwani Foundation</span></p>]]></td>
